"open":{"tax":"After the patches, CAT and DPT carry the as-amended section numbers (s.68, s.79) and a 2026-11-25 status, but the CGT line still cites Bill s.36 (s.37 as amended) with 'NOT enacted as of 2026-10-29', and the RZLT line still cites s.75 (s.78 as amended) with 'as of 2026-10-23'. Those two lines need the same status and numbering update before the section is closed.","price":"The headline moves to RPPI September 2026, but CSO table HPM07 already publishes the September 2026 12-month medians (e.g. Galway City 425,000 against the 420,000 August figure in the table; Galway County 375,000 unchanged). The table and its header stay at August 2026, so the section is one release behind its primary source and should stay open until the medians move to September 2026."}}
